ard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What is a function in Python?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A keyword</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A type of variable</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>An imported library</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A block of code that performs a specific task.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->2</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following keyword is used to define a function in Python?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>func</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>def</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>class</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>void</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->3</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What happens when a variable is defined inside a function and you attempt to access it from outside that function's body?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The variable is accessed normally.</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The variable is stored in the global namespace.</span><br></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The value returns as 'None'.</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Python raises a NameError because the variable exists only in the local scope.</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->4</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which specific keyword is required to modify a variable in the outer (enclosing) function from within an inner function?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>self</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>global</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>nonlocal</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>static</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->5</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>If a function is defined to return a value but does not include a return statement, what will be the result?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The function will return a default value of 0</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The function will return an error</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The function will return None</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The function will return the last executed statement</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->6</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following statements about functions returning other functions is true?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A function cannot return another function in Python</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The returned function can access variables from the outer function</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The returned function must be called immediately</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The outer function's execution must be completed before returning</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->7</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which keyword is used in Python to create an anonymous function that can be defined in a single line without a name?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__o